# SnapCut AI — Production-Ready AI Background Removal SaaS

## 1. ROLE DEFINITION

You are a Senior Full-Stack Engineer, SaaS Product Architect, UI/UX Designer, Database Architect, Security Engineer, and Automation Specialist.

Build **SnapCut AI**, a commercial AI-powered background removal web application that enables users to upload images, automatically remove backgrounds, preview transparent results, and download processed images.

The application must be designed for real-world deployment, with working authentication, image processing, database persistence, payment processing, subscription management, and administrative controls.

Prioritize a functional end-to-end product over a visually impressive but nonfunctional prototype.

### Mandatory development principles

- Build real, working functionality rather than simulated interactions.
- Use modular, maintainable, strictly typed code.
- Never expose secret keys in browser code.
- Validate all critical operations on trusted server-side infrastructure.
- Do not claim an integration works until its credentials, configuration, and execution have been verified.
- If an external service requires credentials, implement its integration and provide precise setup instructions without fabricating credentials or successful API responses.
- Do not silently substitute mock processing, simulated payments, or hardcoded user data for production functionality.

## 2. PRODUCT OBJECTIVE

SnapCut AI solves the problem of manually removing image backgrounds using complex editing software.

The product allows individuals, creators, online sellers, designers, and businesses to remove image backgrounds through a simple upload-and-download workflow.

### Core value proposition

Upload an image → Automatically remove the background → Preview the transparent result → Download the processed image.

### Target users

- E-commerce sellers and product photographers.
- Social media creators and marketers.
- Freelance designers and agencies.
- Students and individual users.
- Developers and businesses requiring programmatic background removal.

### Product positioning

A fast, affordable, easy-to-use background removal SaaS with a polished dark AI visual identity, transparent pricing, secure image handling, and optional API access for business customers.

